# Normalise line endings to LF for every text file.
#
# The pipeline's default run target is a Linux host, and it generates files that execute there —
# cloud-init user data, bootstrap scripts. A shell script checked out with CRLF on Windows fails
# at its shebang before it can log anything: the host boots, then goes quiet. Nothing else in a
# Windows-authored repository prevents that.
* text=auto eol=lf
